UID:af89c1825f37c762@role-environmental-land-use.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260803T200325Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260803
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Do you work in Maine's agriculture\, fishing\
 , or forestry industries? Your Experience Matters.
DESCRIPTION:Home\nSkip to top navigation\nSkip to side navigation\nSkip to
  content\nSkip to footer\nMaine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp
 \n|\nSearch Maine.gov\nDACF Home\n→\nAbout DACF\n→\nNewsroom\n→ News
 \nDo you work in Maine's agriculture\, fishing\, or forestry industries? Y
 our Experience Matters.\nAugust 3\, 2026\nSurvey to Help Shape Mental Heal
 th & Wellness Resources for Maine's Heritage Industries\nIf you work in Ma
 ine's agriculture\, fishing\, or forestry industries\, your experience mat
 ters. Take this anonymous 10-minute survey by August 31\, 2026\, to help s
 hape recommendations that will strengthen mental health and wellness resou
 rces for Maine's heritage industries. Every response helps ensure the reco
 mmendations reflect the real experiences and needs of those who do this wo
 rk every day.\nTake the Survey\nBack to Top\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dacf/ab
 out/news/news.shtml?id=13357572
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dacf/about/news/news.shtml?id=13357572
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
